# The Indigo Plateau, the League's Pokémon Center and its rooms: HeartGold's SEQ_GS_CHAMPROAD, and this game a song of
# its own: a solemn horn in D major over a church organ, held strings, a slow bass and the roll of a timpani, the
# summit every trainer of Johto walks toward. The same by day and night. Original composition for this game (plan
# 20 · J10, part b).
